{"type":"text","timestamp":1794547077427,"sessionID":"ses_e2cad0affffeL00HGhtsGip9s0","part":{"id":"prt_1d357064f0027d3Wb4eKFqbGEq","sessionID":"ses_e2cad0affffeL00HGhtsGip9s0","messageID":"msg_1d356e5af001x4sbgPMz6SSuks","type":"text","text":"T026 is complete. I added the `injected` paragraph to `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md` and its Verify passes.\n\n**File written** (only this one, +7 lines, 0 deletions):\n`.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md` — in §2 CONTRACT, after the four contract bullets and before `Failure codes:`:\n\n- An intro paragraph stating that `loadSession` returns the raw neutral records, that Claude, Pi, Devin and DSH also return `injected` as a list of `{ source, text }` for hook or harness context that `records` never carries, and that `loadSession` passes it through while `readSession` ignores it.\n- One line per runtime naming its source: Claude `hook_additional_context`, Pi the entry's custom type or `custom_message`, Devin `system` and `unflagged-user` plus the step source on the transcript fallback, DSH the event's source kind or `unknown`.\n\nEach claim was checked against the reader code (`claude.mjs:174-183`, `pi.mjs:165-174`, `devin.mjs:189-212` and `317-328`, `dsh.mjs:244-256`, `index.mjs:133-147`).\n\n**Verify output** (`SRR` = the README path):\n```\n$ rg -c \"injected\" .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md; echo exit=$?\n5\nexit=0\n```\nExpected at least 2, observed 5.\n\n**Scoped diff check:**\n```\n$ git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff --stat -- .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md | 7 +++++++\n 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)\n```\nNo em dash or semicolon in the file. The other modified files under `session-readers/` belong to the wave 1–3 workers, not me.\n\n**Routing note:** the advisor sent `sk-doc` to `sk-create-readme`, which is the new-README scaffold packet. T026 edits one paragraph of an existing README, so I applied that packet's durable writing rules (current-state content, no IDs, no em dash or semicolon) and did not run its scaffold workflow, which would have rewritten the file.\n\n**Not done:** I did not tick the T026 checkbox, as instructed. Nothing else is blocked.","time":{"start":1794547058255,"end":1794547077427}}}
